If you want probe level expression values, you will need to extract 
those data from your AffyBatch (probably best after background 
subtraction and normalization).

You can extract e.g., the PM probe values for AFFX-CreX-5_at using the 
pm() accessor function:

pm(abatch, "AFFX-CreX-5_at")

HTH,

Jim


