Message-ID: <C195BBE0.1D6E8%mdavy@hortresearch.co.nz>


Try modfying your statement x[,"FlagA"]="A"|"B"|"C" etc to use the test
operator rather than the assignment operator.
Something like;

okred <- x[,"FlagA"]=="A" | x[,"FlagA"]=="B" | x[,"FlagA"]=="C"


Marcus


